        "Title": "Romeo and Juliet: The Assassination",
        "Location": "LOCATION_WET_RAT",
        "PublicId": "130896775011",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 47424c02-bb0f-4066-af5a-f1cdcdcd08b2).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47.\r\rYour targets are Xiaoqing Feng and Angus Pritchard. One week ago, Xiaoqing Feng cheated on you with Angus Pritchard, and you have personally paid for yourself to assassinate them. To make matters worse, Angus Pritchard, one of your targets, was also part of the experiment in Romania, making you 2 brothers. This is a difficult mission, 47, knowing that you also still love Xiaoqing. I will leave you to prepare.\r\r\r\r\rThis mission, and it&apos;s story, was requested by my sister.",
